do CutsceneManager.disable_player_functionality()
join TowerGuide right [animation="Slide In Up" wait="true"]
TowerGuide: Congratulations! You've completed the Hunter Exam and earned your Hunter License!
TowerGuide: If the default controls don't feel right, you can change them in the Control Settings by pressing ESC. Full controller support will be available soon!
TowerGuide: Good luck in there, and may your bounty be plentiful!
[wait time="2.0"]
do CutsceneManager.enable_player_functionality()
do CutsceneManager.to_first_floor()